Kind: widen
Issue: #657
Holds open: the census's walk, delay(3000) per thread between taking it off the list and reading it, with freed zone elements filled with 0xdeadbeef -- so that the 24 threads -c wakes to end are freed in the middle of the walk if nothing stops them, and a walk that reads one follows a pointer into nothing; the fixed walk holds the processor set's lock, and the threads are freed only after it
Run: --entry 35 600 -smp 4

